  m_text: "\n                      Welcome to Jenny's Diner!\n\nYour Mission\nReady
    to make a delicious burger? Tom the Cat will help you throughout the process.
    Sit back, learn, and make a delicious burger while also learning a bit more about
    them. Meet his daughter Luna too! \U0001F60A\n\nHow to Control\n\nMove & Look:
    Use the Joysticks on your controllers to walk around the diner and turn your
    view.\n\nGrab: Point your controller at an object and hold the Grip or Trigger
    button to pick up ingredients."
